@host = http://localhost:8787

### 1. Cek status API
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Ambil semua daftar tugas
GET {{host}}/tasks

### 3. Filter tugas berdasarkan status selesai (opsional)
GET {{host}}/tasks?completed=false

### 4. Ambil detail tugas berdasarkan ID
GET {{host}}/tasks/102

### 5. Tambah tugas baru
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mengerjakan praktikum REST API Hono",
  "category": "Pemrograman Web",
  "completed": false
}

### 6. Ubah data tugas (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/tasks/102
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Membuat laporan praktikum jaringan",
  "category": "Jaringan Komputer",
  "completed": true
}

### 7. Tandai tugas selesai / belum selesai (PATCH)
PATCH {{host}}/tasks/101/toggle

### 8. Hapus tugas berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/104
